  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "test: Serialize Lua numbers with the C numeric locale",
  "description": "While Lua tonumber can accept the current locale's decimal point in\naddition to period, load()ing an entire string uses the Lua lexer\nand only accepts a period. Our test serializes an entire table, so\nusing, e.g., a comma as in the German locale makes the lexer unable\nto parse a table correctly when unmarshaling.\n\nIf serializing, temporarily set the numeric locale to the C locale.\n\nAdd a test that explicitly sets the locale to German to the list\nof lua tests in different locales.\n\nFix #20749",
